stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_publisher: assert package::from_package(pub)
    q_check_publisher --> q_abort: publisher not from T's package
    q_abort --> [*]: abort 0
    q_check_publisher --> q_create_policy: publisher valid
    q_create_policy --> q_create_cap: TransferPolicy(id, rules=empty, balance=zero)
    q_create_cap --> q_emit: TransferPolicyCap(id, policy_id)
    q_emit --> [*]: emit TransferPolicyCreated, return (policy, cap)

    note right of q_check_publisher
        INV-001: only the package publisher can create TransferPolicy for type T
        INV-002: Publisher verification prevents unauthorized policy creation
        INV-003: policy starts with no rules (freely transferable until rules added)
    end note
